# PlusTok PHP Rules

- Minimum PHP **8.4** — see `09_DEVELOPMENT/03_배포운영.md`
- DB: MySQL 8, snake_case — DDL in `03_SYSTEM/01_DB설계.md`
- REST responses match `03_SYSTEM/02_API설계.md` §5 envelope
- Auth via JWT middleware — `includes/auth.php`
- AI: always `ai_call()` from `includes/ai.php`; keys from DB/env only
- Admin modules: `07_ADMIN/03`, paths under `admin/`
- Prepared statements only — no raw SQL concatenation with user input
